        "data": {
          "contentHtml": "<p>Task: UML Class Diagram for Order Management</p><p>A Customer with a customerNumber places Orders, each identified by an orderNumber. An Order consists of at least one Order Item with a quantity.<br>Each Order Item refers to exactly one Product, identified by a productNumber. Products implement the Sellable interface.</p>",
