        ],
        "data": {
          "contentHtml": "<h2>Task: UML Class Diagram for Order Management</h2><p>Create the model from the highlighted elements and attributes. Highlighted model elements can be dragged directly into the canvas.</p><p>A <mark data-color=\"#BBDEFB\" style=\"background-color: #BBDEFB;\"><span data-task-element-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-element-type=\"uml-class\">Customer</span></mark> with a <mark data-color=\"#C8E6C9\" style=\"background-color: #C8E6C9;\"><span data-task-element-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-element-type=\"uml-text-label\">customerNumber</span></mark> places <mark data-color=\"#BBDEFB\" style=\"background-color: #BBDEFB;\"><span data-task-element-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-element-type=\"uml-class\">Orders</span></mark>, each identified by an <mark data-color=\"#C8E6C9\" style=\"background-color: #C8E6C9;\"><span data-task-element-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-element-type=\"uml-text-label\">orderNumber</span></mark>. An <mark data-color=\"#BBDEFB\" style=\"background-color: #BBDEFB;\"><span data-task-element-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-element-type=\"uml-class\">Order</span></mark> consists of at least one <mark data-color=\"#BBDEFB\" style=\"background-color: #BBDEFB;\"><span data-task-element-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-element-type=\"uml-class\">Order Item</span></mark> with a <mark data-color=\"#C8E6C9\" style=\"background-color: #C8E6C9;\"><span data-task-element-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-element-type=\"uml-text-label\">quantity</span></mark>.<br>Each <mark data-color=\"#BBDEFB\" style=\"background-color: #BBDEFB;\"><span data-task-element-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-element-type=\"uml-class\">Order Item</span></mark> refers to exactly one <mark data-color=\"#BBDEFB\" style=\"background-color: #BBDEFB;\"><span data-task-element-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-element-type=\"uml-class\">Product</span></mark>, identified by a <mark data-color=\"#C8E6C9\" style=\"background-color: #C8E6C9;\"><span data-task-element-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-element-type=\"uml-text-label\">productNumber</span></mark>. <mark data-color=\"#BBDEFB\" style=\"background-color: #BBDEFB;\"><span data-task-element-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-element-type=\"uml-class\">Product</span></mark> implements the <mark data-color=\"#FFE0B2\" style=\"background-color: #FFE0B2;\"><span data-task-element-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-element-type=\"uml-interface\">Sellable</span></mark> interface.</p><h3>Connections</h3><ul><li>Connect Customer to Order with an <mark data-color=\"#E1BEE7\" style=\"background-color: #E1BEE7;\"><span data-task-connection-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-connection-type=\"uml-association\">Association</span></mark>.</li><li>Connect Order to Order Item with a <mark data-color=\"#E1BEE7\" style=\"background-color: #E1BEE7;\"><span data-task-connection-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-connection-type=\"uml-composition\">Composition</span></mark>.</li><li>Connect Order Item to Product with an <mark data-color=\"#E1BEE7\" style=\"background-color: #E1BEE7;\"><span data-task-connection-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-connection-type=\"uml-association\">Association</span></mark>.</li><li>Connect Product to Sellable with a <mark data-color=\"#E1BEE7\" style=\"background-color: #E1BEE7;\"><span data-task-connection-language-id=\"a7fb2523-f7a0-4d23-b476-72882454b9e8\" data-task-connection-type=\"uml-realization\">Realization</span></mark>.</li></ul>",
